#: ../../interface.rst:2
msgid "The interface"
msgstr "界面"

#: ../../interface.rst:4
msgid ""
"Orbit has a top toolbar, a left sidebar, and a scrollable genome-view "
"area. Within the view, each track has a label cell and one canvas per "
"locus panel. The status bar at the bottom reports the active locus, "
"window size, scale, assembly, and data-request timing."
msgstr ""
"Orbit "
"顶部有工具栏，左侧有侧栏，中央是可滚动的基因组视图区域。在视图中，每条轨道都有标签单元格，每个位点面板都有一个画布。底部状态栏报告活动位点、窗口大小、刻度、装配和数据请求耗时。"

#: ../../interface.rst:10
msgid "Toolbar"
msgstr "工具栏"

#: ../../interface.rst:12
msgid ""
"The controls run from assembly selection and search to data import, "
"comparison, and export:"
msgstr "控件从装配选择和搜索，到数据导入、比较与导出："

#: ../../interface.rst:15
msgid ""
"**Assembly selector** — click the assembly name beside the Orbit logo and"
" choose a genome. Select **hg38** before following the human-gene "
"examples. Switching assembly opens a default region and updates the "
"annotation and sequence source; it does not translate old coordinates or "
"imported files."
msgstr ""
" 装配选择器  —— 点击 Orbit 标志旁的装配名称并选择基因组。按照人类基因示例操作前请选择  hg38 "
"。切换装配会打开默认区域并更新注释和序列源；不会转换旧坐标或导入文件。"

#: ../../interface.rst:19
msgid ""
"**Search box** — enter a gene symbol or a chromosome-qualified "
"coordinate, such as ``TP53`` or ``chr17:7,668,402-7,687,550``, and press "
":kbd:`Enter`. Multiple resolvable terms, for example ``TP53, BRCA1``, "
"create separate panels (up to five). This searches the bundled "
"annotation, not motif patterns."
msgstr ""
" 搜索框  —— 输入基因符号或带染色体的坐标，例如 ``TP53`` 或 ``chr17:7,668,402-7,687,550``，然后按  "
":kbd:`Enter` 。多个可解析的词（如 ``TP53, BRCA1``）会创建独立面板（最多五个）。这里搜索的是内置注释，而不是基序模式。"

#: ../../interface.rst:23
msgid ""
"**GTF search** — appears after a GTF/GFF annotation is imported. It "
"searches imported gene names; its selector limits the search to all "
"imported gene tracks or a specific one."
msgstr " GTF 搜索  —— 导入 GTF/GFF 注释后出现。它搜索导入的基因名称；其选择器可将搜索范围限制为所有导入基因轨道或某一条轨道。"

#: ../../interface.rst:26
msgid ""
"**Import** — opens the local file chooser; drag-and-drop is an "
"alternative. Wait for the import progress panel to finish before "
"inspecting the track."
msgstr " 导入  —— 打开本地文件选择器，也可以拖放文件。等待导入进度面板完成后再查看轨道。"

#: ../../interface.rst:28
msgid "**Split** — choose **1 panel** through **5 panels** for independent loci."
msgstr " 分屏  —— 为独立位点选择  1 个面板  到  5 个面板 。"

#: ../../interface.rst:29
msgid ""
"**Export** — opens **Include track labels**, **PNG**, **SVG**, and "
"**PDF**. It is the download-arrow button next to Split, not a keyboard "
"save command."
msgstr " 导出  —— 打开  包含轨道标签 、 PNG 、 SVG  和  PDF  选项。它是分屏旁的下载箭头按钮，不是键盘保存命令。"

#: ../../interface.rst:31
msgid ""
"**Motif** — opens a separate dialog for nucleotide, IUPAC, or regular "
"expression patterns. Hits are added as plus/minus tracks; reference "
"sequence is required and motif hits are hidden when the window exceeds 1 "
"Mb."
msgstr ""
" 基序  —— 打开用于核苷酸、IUPAC 或正则表达式模式的独立对话框。命中会作为正链/负链轨道添加；需要参考序列，且窗口超过 1 Mb "
"时会隐藏基序命中。"

#: ../../interface.rst:34
msgid ""
"**Whole chromosome** — fits the current chromosome in the active panel. "
"**- / +** zoom out/in around that panel's centre."
msgstr " 整条染色体  —— 使当前染色体适合活动面板。 - / +  围绕该面板中心缩小/放大。"

#: ../../interface.rst:36
msgid ""
"**Theme** — the sun icon switches light/dark appearance. The language "
"button at the far right switches Chinese/English and reloads the page."
msgstr " 主题  —— 太阳图标切换浅色/深色外观。最右侧的语言按钮切换中英文并重新加载页面。"

#: ../../interface.rst:39
msgid "Orbit toolbar, sidebar, track labels, and genome-view canvases."
msgstr "Orbit 工具栏、侧栏、轨道标签和基因组视图画布。"

#: ../../interface.rst:44
msgid ""
"Interface overview at ``ACTB`` on hg38: choose the assembly before "
"searching. The sidebar manages track visibility and selected-gene "
"details; the main label cells contain settings buttons beside the plotted"
" data."
msgstr "hg38 上 ``ACTB`` 的界面概览：请先选择装配再搜索。侧栏管理轨道可见性和选定基因详情；主标签单元格在绘图数据旁包含设置按钮。"

#: ../../interface.rst:49
msgid "Track labels"
msgstr "轨道标签"

#: ../../interface.rst:51
msgid "Distinguish the **sidebar list** from the **label cell beside a canvas**:"
msgstr "区分  侧栏列表  与  画布旁的标签单元格 ："

#: ../../interface.rst:53
msgid ""
"Expand **Tracks** in the sidebar to reveal the built-in visibility "
"checkboxes; this section is initially collapsed. Imported annotations and"
" sequence tracks have their checkboxes under **Imported**, and "
"quantitative tracks under **Signal tracks**."
msgstr ""
"展开侧栏中的  Tracks  以显示内置可见性复选框；该部分初始折叠。导入的注释和序列轨道复选框位于  已导入  下，定量轨道复选框位于  "
"信号轨道  下。"

#: ../../interface.rst:57
msgid ""
"Click a name in an imported/signal sidebar list to select a track, not to"
" open its settings. Hold :kbd:`Ctrl` while clicking names to select "
"several. Right-click selected signal tracks for shared-axis or shared-"
"colour actions; imported-track batch actions include deletion."
msgstr ""
"点击导入/信号侧栏列表中的名称是选择轨道，而不是打开设置。按住  :kbd:`Ctrl`  "
"并点击名称可选择多个轨道。右键点击选中的信号轨道可执行共享坐标轴或共享颜色操作；导入轨道的批量操作包括删除。"

#: ../../interface.rst:61
msgid ""
"Click a **gear** in a canvas track label to open that track's settings. "
"Right-clicking a RefSeq, GC, signal, or imported gene-track label also "
"opens its settings. There is no universal rename/reload menu."
msgstr ""
"点击画布轨道标签中的  齿轮  打开该轨道的设置。右键点击 "
"RefSeq、GC、信号或导入的基因轨道标签也会打开设置。没有通用的重命名/重新加载菜单。"

#: ../../interface.rst:64
msgid ""
"Drag a canvas track label vertically to reorder rows. Drag the boundary "
"between label cells and canvases horizontally to change the label-column "
"width; double-click that boundary to reset the width."
msgstr "垂直拖动画布轨道标签可重新排列行。水平拖动标签单元格与画布之间的边界可调整标签列宽度；双击该边界可重置宽度。"

#: ../../interface.rst:67
msgid ""
"A remove action deletes an imported copy from Orbit's loaded-data area. "
"Unchecking a track only hides it; use that when the data must be kept."
msgstr "移除操作会从 Orbit 的已加载数据区域删除导入副本。取消勾选轨道只会隐藏它；若要保留数据，请使用此方式。"

#: ../../interface.rst:71
msgid "Track types"
msgstr "轨道类型"

#: ../../interface.rst:77
msgid "Track"
msgstr "轨道"

#: ../../interface.rst:78
msgid "What it draws and how to use it"
msgstr "绘制内容及使用方法"

#: ../../interface.rst:79
msgid "Ideogram"
msgstr "染色体示意图"

#: ../../interface.rst:80
msgid ""
"Cytobands for the current chromosome and a red marker for the window. "
"Click within the ideogram to move the window along that chromosome."
msgstr "当前染色体的细胞遗传带及窗口红色标记。点击示意图内的任意位置可沿该染色体移动窗口。"

#: ../../interface.rst:82
msgid "Ruler"
msgstr "标尺"

#: ../../interface.rst:83
msgid ""
"Coordinates and ticks that change scale with zoom. Search coordinates are"
" 1-based with an inclusive end."
msgstr "随缩放改变刻度的坐标和刻度线。搜索坐标从 1 开始且包含终点。"

#: ../../interface.rst:85
msgid "RefSeq / imported genes"
msgstr "RefSeq / 导入基因"

#: ../../interface.rst:86
msgid ""
"Merged gene models or individual transcript rows. Click a model or its "
"text label for details; use the small plus/minus control to expand it."
msgstr "合并的基因模型或独立的转录本行。点击模型或文本标签查看详情；使用小型加号/减号控件展开。"

#: ../../interface.rst:88
msgid "Signal"
msgstr "信号"

#: ../../interface.rst:89
msgid ""
"bigWig/bedGraph values or BAM coverage as bars. The track gear controls "
"range and colour; grouping shares a scale, not a canvas overlay."
msgstr "bigWig/bedGraph 数值或 BAM 覆盖度以柱状显示。轨道齿轮控制范围和颜色；分组共享刻度，而不是叠加到同一画布。"

#: ../../interface.rst:91
msgid "BAM alignments"
msgstr "BAM 比对"

#: ../../interface.rst:92
msgid ""
"Stacked reads below coverage, with a separate Align checkbox. The main "
"BAM checkbox must also be on for the read row to appear."
msgstr "覆盖度下方堆叠显示 reads，并有独立的比对复选框。要显示 reads 行，主 BAM 复选框也必须开启。"

#: ../../interface.rst:94
msgid "GC content"
msgstr "GC 含量"

#: ../../interface.rst:95
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Windowed GC percentage on a fixed 30%-70% axis. Off initially; requires "
"an available reference sequence source."
msgstr "固定 30%-70% 坐标轴上的窗口 GC 百分比。初始关闭；需要可用的参考序列源。"

#: ../../interface.rst:97
msgid "Sequence"
msgstr "序列"

#: ../../interface.rst:98
msgid ""
"Reference bases at about 1.2 bp/px or closer. Off initially; the strand "
"arrow shows the complementary strand, and Aa opens translation controls."
msgstr "约在 1.2 bp/px 或更近时显示参考碱基。初始关闭；链箭头显示互补链，Aa 按钮打开翻译控件。"

#: ../../interface.rst:100
msgid "Whole-genome overview"
msgstr "全基因组概览"

#: ../../interface.rst:101
msgid ""
"Initially a compact strip. Expand it to see chromosome rows and click a "
"row to navigate; each split panel has its own overview."
msgstr "初始为紧凑条带。展开后可查看染色体行并点击行进行导航；每个分屏面板都有自己的概览。"

#: ../../interface.rst:105
msgid "Gene track settings"
msgstr "基因轨道设置"

#: ../../interface.rst:107
msgid ""
"Open the gear in **RefSeq** or an imported GTF/GFF track-label cell. "
"These are the actual options in the gene settings popover:"
msgstr "打开  RefSeq  或导入的 GTF/GFF 轨道标签单元格中的齿轮。这些是基因设置弹出框中的实际选项："

#: ../../interface.rst:114 ../../interface.rst:158
msgid "Setting"
msgstr "设置项"

#: ../../interface.rst:115 ../../interface.rst:159
msgid "Effect"
msgstr "作用"

#: ../../interface.rst:116
msgid "Expand all"
msgstr "全部展开"

#: ../../interface.rst:117
msgid ""
"Show each transcript on its own row. Genes newly revealed by panning or "
"zooming also remain expanded while this option is on."
msgstr "每个转录本单独显示一行。启用此选项后，通过平移或缩放新显示的基因也会保持展开。"

#: ../../interface.rst:119
msgid "Collapse all"
msgstr "全部折叠"

#: ../../interface.rst:120
msgid "Draw a merged model for each gene and clear individual expansion choices."
msgstr "为每个基因绘制合并模型，并清除单独的展开选择。"

#: ../../interface.rst:121
msgid "Plus-strand / Minus-strand colour"
msgstr "正链 / 负链颜色"

#: ../../interface.rst:122
msgid "Choose colours independently with a palette or the custom colour picker."
msgstr "使用调色板或自定义颜色选择器分别选择颜色。"

#: ../../interface.rst:123
msgid "CDS / UTR colour"
msgstr "CDS / UTR 颜色"

#: ../../interface.rst:124
msgid "Set the coding and untranslated feature colours."
msgstr "设置编码区和非翻译特征的颜色。"

#: ../../interface.rst:125 ../../interface.rst:176
msgid "Reset / Done"
msgstr "重置 / 完成"

#: ../../interface.rst:126
msgid "Reset this track's colour/expansion choices, or close the popover."
msgstr "重置该轨道的颜色/展开选择，或关闭弹出框。"

#: ../../interface.rst:128
msgid ""
"Imported gene tracks follow the RefSeq colours unless a colour is set on "
"that imported track itself. An imported track's overrides do not recolour"
" other tracks. There are no label-mode or row-height controls in this "
"popover."
msgstr "导入的基因轨道沿用 RefSeq 颜色，除非在该导入轨道自身上设置颜色。导入轨道的覆盖设置不会重新着色其他轨道。此弹出框没有标签模式或行高控件。"

#: ../../interface.rst:132
msgid ""
"For just one gene, click the small **+** near the end of its model (or "
"**-** when expanded). When space is tight the button can appear on the "
"left. Click the gene model or name to populate **Selection / details** "
"with its locus, strand, length, transcript count, and a "
"transcript/exon/CDS table. Multi-transcript genes also have a Show / Hide"
" control in those details. Clicking this model to select it is distinct "
"from clicking its expansion button."
msgstr ""
"仅展开一个基因时，点击其模型末端附近的小  + （展开后为  - ）。空间不足时按钮可能出现在左侧。点击基因模型或名称，会在  选择 / 详情  "
"中填入其位点、链、长度、转录本数量以及转录本/外显子/CDS 表。多转录本基因的详情中还提供显示 / "
"隐藏控件。点击模型进行选择与点击展开按钮是不同的操作。"

#: ../../interface.rst:139
msgid "An annotation track with transcripts expanded into separate rows."
msgstr "转录本展开为独立行的注释轨道。"

#: ../../interface.rst:144
msgid ""
"Expanded ``EGFR`` transcripts on hg38 allow exon/CDS structure to be "
"compared row by row. Expand all / Collapse all act on one annotation "
"track; the small per-gene button affects only that gene."
msgstr "hg38 上展开的 ``EGFR`` 转录本可以逐行比较外显子/CDS 结构。全部展开 / 全部折叠作用于一条注释轨道；单个基因按钮只影响该基因。"

#: ../../interface.rst:149
msgid "Signal track settings"
msgstr "信号轨道设置"

#: ../../interface.rst:151
msgid ""
"For a bigWig, bedGraph, or BAM coverage row, click its gear or right-"
"click its canvas label. Changes are applied to the view as you edit them."
msgstr "对于 bigWig、bedGraph 或 BAM 覆盖度行，点击其齿轮或右键点击画布标签。编辑设置时会立即应用到视图。"

#: ../../interface.rst:160
msgid "Colour"
msgstr "颜色"

#: ../../interface.rst:161
msgid "Pick a palette colour or a custom colour for the signal bars."
msgstr "选择调色板颜色或自定义颜色设置信号柱。"

#: ../../interface.rst:162
msgid "Data range"
msgstr "数据范围"

#: ../../interface.rst:163
msgid ""
"Auto follows the visible window; Fixed enables Min / max inputs and keeps"
" that range while navigating."
msgstr "自动模式跟随可见窗口；固定模式启用最小值/最大值输入框，并在导航时保持该范围。"

#: ../../interface.rst:165
msgid "Log scale (log10)"
msgstr "对数刻度（log10）"

#: ../../interface.rst:166
msgid ""
"Uses a positive logarithmic scale for signals spanning orders of "
"magnitude."
msgstr "对跨越多个数量级的信号使用正值对数刻度。"

#: ../../interface.rst:168
msgid "Track group"
msgstr "轨道组"

#: ../../interface.rst:169
msgid ""
"Assign a group or create a new one. Enable group autoscale to use a "
"common range across its members, which remain in separate rows."
msgstr "分配一个组或创建新组。启用组自动缩放可让组成员使用共同范围，但它们仍显示在独立行中。"

#: ../../interface.rst:171
msgid "Colour alignments by strand"
msgstr "按链为比对着色"

#: ../../interface.rst:172
msgid ""
"Available for BAM; changes the read row from the default grey to strand-"
"specific colours."
msgstr "BAM 可用；将 reads 行从默认灰色改为按链区分的颜色。"

#: ../../interface.rst:174
msgid "Remove this track"
msgstr "移除此轨道"

#: ../../interface.rst:175
msgid "Removes an imported copy, or hides a bundled signal track."
msgstr "删除导入副本，或隐藏内置信号轨道。"

#: ../../interface.rst:177
msgid "Reset this signal track's settings, or close the popover."
msgstr "重置信号轨道设置，或关闭弹出框。"

#: ../../interface.rst:179
msgid ""
"To share a range quickly, select several signal-track names in the "
"sidebar with :kbd:`Ctrl` + click, then right-click a selected name and "
"choose **Group autoscale**. The same batch menu provides shared colours. "
"The settings do not offer line/area drawing modes or sample overlays."
msgstr ""
"要快速共享范围，请在侧栏中按住  :kbd:`Ctrl`  并点击选择多个信号轨道名称，然后右键点击选中名称并选择  组自动缩放 "
"。相同的批量菜单还提供共享颜色。设置不提供折线/面积绘制模式或样本叠加。"

#: ../../interface.rst:185
msgid "Display options"
msgstr "显示选项"

#: ../../interface.rst:187
msgid ""
"The sun button switches light/dark theme for the current view. The whole-"
"genome overview's small triangle expands or collapses its chromosome "
"rows; it is a direct button, not an appearance menu. There is no global "
"label-density option. The current build resets track presentation "
"preferences on a new page load, so do not rely on refresh, language "
"switching, or reopening the application to preserve track order, colours,"
" or expanded transcripts. Previously imported files can remain in the "
"sidebar while their checkboxes start off; check them again to display "
"them."
msgstr "太阳按钮切换当前视图的浅色/深色主题。全基因组概览的小三角展开或折叠染色体行；它是直接按钮，而不是外观菜单。没有全局标签密度选项。当前版本在重新加载页面时会重置轨道显示偏好，因此不要依赖刷新、切换语言或重新打开应用来保留轨道顺序、颜色或展开的转录本。以前导入的文件可能仍显示在侧栏中，但其复选框默认关闭；请重新勾选以显示它们。"

#: ../../interface.rst:197
msgid "Split-panel operation"
msgstr "分屏操作"

#: ../../interface.rst:199
msgid ""
"Click **Split** and select 2-5 panels, or enter several genes in the main"
" search. Panels share one assembly and one track list, but have "
"independent loci and zoom levels."
msgstr "点击  分屏  并选择 2-5 个面板，或在主搜索框中输入多个基因。面板共享一个装配和一套轨道列表，但位点和缩放级别彼此独立。"

#: ../../interface.rst:202
msgid ""
"Click a panel's **Locus** cell to make it active. Its highlight "
"identifies the target of the main search, arrow keys, and toolbar zoom. "
"Clicking the same cell again can remove the highlight without changing "
"that target."
msgstr "点击面板的  位点  单元格使其处于活动状态。高亮显示主搜索、方向键和工具栏缩放的目标。再次点击同一单元格可以取消高亮，但不会改变该目标。"

#: ../../interface.rst:205
msgid ""
"Enter a gene or chromosome-qualified coordinate directly in a panel's "
"Locus field and press :kbd:`Enter` to change just that panel. Dragging a "
"canvas pans that panel; mouse-wheel and double-click zoom target the "
"panel under the pointer."
msgstr ""
"在面板的位点字段中直接输入基因或带染色体的坐标，然后按  :kbd:`Enter` "
"，只更改该面板。拖动画布可平移该面板；鼠标滚轮和双击缩放作用于指针所在的面板。"

#: ../../interface.rst:209
msgid ""
"Close a panel using its **x**, or choose **1 panel** in Split. Lowering "
"the count removes panels from the right."
msgstr "使用  x  关闭面板，或在分屏中选择  1 个面板 。减少数量会从右侧移除面板。"

#: ../../interface.rst:212
msgid "Four side-by-side locus panels with separate position fields."
msgstr "带有独立位置字段的四个并排位点面板。"

#: ../../interface.rst:217
msgid ""
"Four-panel comparison of ``ACTB``, ``EGFR``, ``TP53``, and ``MYC`` on "
"hg38. Each position field changes one locus; the active cell controls "
"where main-search and keyboard actions are sent."
msgstr ""
"hg38 上 ``ACTB``、``EGFR``、``TP53`` 和 ``MYC`` "
"的四面板比较。每个位置字段只更改一个位点；活动单元格决定主搜索和键盘操作的目标。"

#: ../../interface.rst:222
msgid "Export workflow"
msgstr "导出流程"

#: ../../interface.rst:224
msgid ""
"After arranging tracks and panels, click **Export** beside Split, set "
"**Include track labels**, and choose **PNG**, **SVG**, or **PDF**. The "
"output contains visible track rows and all current panels, not the "
"toolbar/sidebar. The filename includes the assembly, the active locus, "
"and a ``_splitN`` suffix for multiple panels. PNG is 2x raster; SVG is "
"vector; PDF is vector with an embedded CJK font when available, with a "
"reported raster fallback otherwise. See :doc:`data-export` for the "
"complete workflow."
msgstr ""
"排列好轨道和面板后，点击分屏旁的  导出 ，勾选  包含轨道标签 ，然后选择  PNG 、 SVG  或  PDF "
"。输出包含可见轨道行和当前所有面板，不包含工具栏/侧栏。文件名包括装配、活动位点以及多面板时的 ``_splitN`` 后缀。PNG 为 2 "
"倍光栅；SVG 为矢量；有可用 CJK 字体时 PDF 为嵌入字体的矢量，否则会报告光栅回退。完整流程见  :doc:`data-export` "
"。"

#: ../../interface.rst:233
msgid "Keyboard and mouse reference"
msgstr "键盘和鼠标参考"

#: ../../interface.rst:235
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Outside text inputs, :kbd:`←` / :kbd:`→` pan the active panel by 35% of "
"its window, :kbd:`+` / :kbd:`=` zoom in twofold, and :kbd:`-` / :kbd:`_` "
"zoom out twofold. :kbd:`/` focuses and selects the main search text. "
":kbd:`Esc` dismisses settings/context popovers and clears gene selection "
"outside inputs. In search fields, :kbd:`↑` / :kbd:`↓` select suggestions "
"and :kbd:`Enter` submits; :kbd:`Esc` dismisses suggestions. Navigation "
"keys are not handled while the Motif dialog is open."
msgstr ""
"在文本输入框外， :kbd:`←`  /  :kbd:`→`  让活动面板按其窗口宽度的 35% 平移， :kbd:`+`  /  "
":kbd:`=`  放大两倍， :kbd:`-`  /  :kbd:`_`  缩小两倍。 :kbd:`/`  聚焦并选中主搜索文本。 "
":kbd:`Esc`  关闭设置/上下文弹出框，并在输入框外清除基因选择。在搜索框中， :kbd:`↑`  /  :kbd:`↓`  选择建议， "
":kbd:`Enter`  提交； :kbd:`Esc`  关闭建议。Motif 对话框打开时不会处理导航键。"

#: ../../interface.rst:243
msgid ""
"Horizontal canvas dragging pans, rather than selecting a genomic "
"interval. The mouse wheel zooms around the pointer and double-clicking "
"zooms in. There are no application bindings for :kbd:`Ctrl+F`, "
":kbd:`Ctrl+S`, a Shift-arrow fine-pan step, or :kbd:`Home`; use search, "
"Export, and Whole chromosome in the toolbar for those tasks."
msgstr ""
"水平拖动画布会平移，而不是选择基因组区间。鼠标滚轮围绕指针缩放，双击放大。应用没有  :kbd:`Ctrl+F` 、 :kbd:`Ctrl+S` "
"、Shift 加方向键微调平移或  :kbd:`Home`  的绑定；这些任务请使用工具栏中的搜索、导出和整条染色体。"

